WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE Track: 1-02 - A New Light
NOTE Artist: The Paper Wall
NOTE Album: 2001: Static and Silence (Book 1)

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:30.000
[Instrumental Intro: Rock Band & Worried Flute Melody]

00:00:30.379 --> 00:00:37.824
The world felt gray, a missing piece

00:00:41.086 --> 00:00:46.230
A quiet, slow, and sad release

00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:54.500
A chapter closed, a best friend gone

00:00:54.600 --> 00:01:02.000
Just trying to find a way to carry on

00:01:02.704 --> 00:01:09.500
The days were long, the colors faded

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:14.087
A little lost and worn and jaded

00:01:18.283 --> 00:01:23.800
Then you walked in and caught my eye

00:01:23.900 --> 00:01:28.488
Beneath a dull community college sky

00:01:29.000 --> 00:02:13.000
[Instrumental Interlude: Flute & Guitar]

00:02:13.523 --> 00:02:17.745
You talk of dreams and taking flight

00:02:21.026 --> 00:02:25.828
Of leaving all the dark for light

00:02:28.329 --> 00:02:34.200
You say you see the real me there

00:02:34.300 --> 00:02:39.254
A kindred soul beyond compare

00:02:45.077 --> 00:02:50.581
It feels so fast, it feels so right

00:02:53.603 --> 00:02:59.367
A sudden star in my dark night

00:03:00.928 --> 00:03:06.500
You fill the void, you bridge the gap

00:03:06.600 --> 00:03:09.114
A perfect escape

00:03:14.118 --> 00:03:21.500
I see a new light in your lonely room

00:03:21.600 --> 00:03:26.720
But there's a shadow chasing after you

00:03:30.103 --> 00:03:35.800
You see a fast car on an open road

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:42.871
I see a heavy, heavy load

00:03:43.111 --> 00:03:47.054
And for the first time in a long, long while...

00:03:47.500 --> 00:04:06.800
[Flute & Guitar Solo]

00:04:07.198 --> 00:04:12.060
And you're a new light in a lonely room

00:04:14.681 --> 00:04:19.442
Chasing away the coming gloom

00:04:22.123 --> 00:04:27.200
You're a fast car on an open road

00:04:27.300 --> 00:04:29.586
Lifting off a heavy load

00:04:34.912 --> 00:04:40.200
And for the first time in a long, long while...

00:04:40.300 --> 00:04:43.200
A new light...

00:04:43.300 --> 00:04:49.502
Oh, my dear brother, please be smart

00:04:51.343 --> 00:04:56.800
This new light's going to break your heart...

00:04:56.900 --> 00:04:59.028
It's going to break your heart...

00:04:59.200 --> 00:05:05.500
[Outro]
